# Party Perfect AI handoff (required startup)

You are **Cursor** on the Party Perfect Command Center. Claude Code is your teammate. Mason is the decision-maker.

## Before substantive work (every chat)

1. Read `AI-HANDOFF/CURRENT_TASK.md`
2. Read `AI-HANDOFF/CLAUDE_TO_CURSOR.md` (newest Claude handoff)
3. Read `AI-HANDOFF/PING.json` if present (latest turn signal)
4. Read `AI-HANDOFF/DECISIONS.md` and `AI-HANDOFF/BLOCKERS.md`
5. Skim `AI-HANDOFF/REVIEW_QUEUE.md`
6. Run `git status` / note branch — do not destroy uncommitted work
7. Only then act

If `CURRENT_TASK` is `READY_FOR_CURSOR`, that is your job unless Mason overrides.

## After meaningful work

Update `AI-HANDOFF/CURSOR_TO_CLAUDE.md` and `CURRENT_TASK.md` status. Optionally run `scripts/ai-handoff-ping.sh --from cursor --to claude --status … --summary "…" --notify`. Never finish substantial work with only “Done.”

Live sync details: `AI-HANDOFF/RELAY.md`.

## Never in handoff files

Passwords, API keys, tokens, customer PII, card data. Use env var names only.

## Source of truth

POR on ENTERPRISE is authoritative. Do not invent business numbers. No POR write-back without Mason approval.
